{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_906.unity3d","item_key":"commands[2].text","source_sha256":"69b3124ce621d94cb59ca128f689f442ff86de97ad511267f4cb1b628c80725d","ja":"発覚した一大事","zh":"发现的重大事件","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_906.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"b4efa97da9959ed95886cdfc1e51c14ebcfc1f50323e7d17f8ab24a3ffb62e62","ja":"着替え終わったよー♪\n……って、あれ？　まだ翼しか来てないの？","zh":"换好衣服啦——♪\n……咦？怎么还只有翼来了？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_906.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"6becf0f42abe3ca7efd80433cb05a59e9030d85c937912717875f7f62870ab16","ja":"お疲れさまです、恵美さん。まつりさんと\n貴音さんなら、そろそろ来ると思いますよ？","zh":"辛苦了，惠美。茉莉和贵音应该差不多要来了吧？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_906.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"38c0f8d884eed5027d334a3a174bd5a58771c377d9d2c515c46b0af9422d8f42","ja":"そっか。まあ、リハまでまだ時間あるしね。\nそれよりアタシ、今日の公演、すごい楽しみなんだ～。","zh":"这样啊。嗯，离彩排还有时间呢。\n比起那个，我特别期待今天的公演～。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_906.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"e1f65fa810442863e8334f6d4679b21790b8c1999f7dcc68d3c3eb4cc13c2edc","ja":"このメンバーで歌うのって、久しぶりでしょ？\nだからかな、いつも以上に気合い入っちゃってさ。","zh":"用这个阵容唱歌，已经是很久以前的事了吧？也许正因为如此，我比平时更加干劲十足。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_906.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"4eb533793423ab1b370274dd74ed083903759fd925693e6d31afa9d6abc7f8e0","ja":"わたしもわたしも～！　特にMCパートの朗読劇！\nみんなでお芝居するの、すっごく楽しみなんです♪","zh":"我也是我也是～！尤其是MC环节的朗读剧！\n大家一起演戏，我特别期待♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_906.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"221391f0cc7424a8c4a5dc41c3ae55a9b4e80cf52a19be0388b08288487e62ce","ja":"にゃはは。翼、それずっと言ってるよね。\n朗読のレッスンも、めっちゃ頑張ってたし。","zh":"呀哈哈。翼，你一直都在说那个呢。\n朗读课上也特别努力。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_906.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"0939e1894e0cf8ba6c0e70caad52deef6043f817211cceda39a4bc04cfb8e023","ja":"えへへっ♪　だって同じシーンを練習してても、\nいっつも誰かのお芝居が変わるから面白くって。","zh":"嘿嘿♪因为就算练习的是同一个场景，每次也总会有人演出不一样，特别有意思。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_906.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"b8dcd47df1ad3ddba1f61aaf1af6e5c71e4f4e00fbfbb89f7c854fb2bc511e8e","ja":"みんなレッスン中に、いろいろ試してたしね。\nそうだ！　まだ時間あるし、一緒に読み合わせする？","zh":"大家在练习的时候也尝试了各种各样的东西嘛。  \n对了！时间还够，要不要一起对台词？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_906.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"e0e243e03beffda0cc8e5c60efadef53df1be9e756caf99c67ef80dc2229d1e1","ja":"いいんですか？\nわあ～、やりますやりまーす！","zh":"可以吗？\n哇～要做，我做就是啦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_906.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"24c4cd4a20de5522b10285e4197cef706f9e3c89df1e02809bb14453a39b4977","ja":"それじゃ台本、台本っと\n……あ、あれ～？","zh":"那么，剧本、剧本……\n……啊，奇怪～？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_906.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"899af742bc505303fb70b60129154d5a326aad65cd926cb694d370520bc9427b","ja":"ん？　どしたの、翼？","zh":"嗯？怎么了，翼？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_906.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"10f9b9b10d115c052fbe15c78a2120f1a1660135354491555cc2b6f59b7af850","ja":"恵美さん……どうしよ～！？\nわたし、台本忘れてきちゃったかも～！","zh":"惠美……怎么办呀～！？\n我好像把剧本忘在那边了～！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T17:39:49+00:00"}
